@node Overview
@chapter Overview

Sake is a minimalist, high-performance build system written entirely
in GNU Guile Scheme. It uses Scheme expressions to describe target 
dependencies and build DAGs.

@node Invocation
@chapter Invocation

To run Sake with a default @file{sakefile.scm}:

@example
sake
@end example

